    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[12 — September 4, 2020]]></title>
        <id>title-e7aa45a3eba2dc03fcaad7396dd13cab</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMware_Fusion?link_extraction_failed=true"/>
        <updated>2026-04-28T13:39:33.558Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[VMware Fusion Player is introduced. Similar to its Workstation counterpart, <a href="/wiki/VMware_Workstation_Player" title="VMware Workstation Player">VMware Workstation Player</a>, it is released for free for non-commercial use. Fusion 12 adds support for <a href="/wiki/MacOS_Big_Sur" title="MacOS Big Sur">macOS Big Sur</a>, DirectX 11 and OpenGL 4.1, an external GPU, USB 3.1, and more. Security fixes were also introduced.<sup id="cite_ref-:0_16-2" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-:0-16"><span class="cite-bracket">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup>]]></content>
    </entry>
    <entry>
