        <updated>2026-04-28T13:39:33.558Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[Optimized for <a href="/wiki/MacOS_Big_Sur" title="MacOS Big Sur">macOS 11 Big Sur</a> as host and guest (<a href="/wiki/MacOS_Catalina" title="MacOS Catalina">macOS 10.15 Catalina</a> is also supported as host). New guest operating system support, such as Windows 10 20H2, Ubuntu 20.10, RHEL 8.3, and Fedora 33. Fusion health check. Includes docker-machine-driver-vmware. Performance improvements, bug fixes and security updates.<sup id="cite_ref-12.1.0_release_notes_90-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-12.1.0_release_notes-90"><span class="cite-bracket">[</span>90<span class="cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup>]]></content>
